WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:29.710
The king was bored.

2
00:00:29.711 --> 00:00:39.075
"Read a book," the queen said.

3
00:00:39.076 --> 00:00:42.533
"It's raining," the king said.

4
00:00:42.534 --> 00:00:45.192
"Rain makes me grumpy."

5
00:00:45.193 --> 00:00:48.084
"Dirk," said the queen.

6
00:00:48.085 --> 00:00:50.527
"Fetch the new jester.

7
00:00:50.528 --> 00:00:53.149
He'll make the king laugh."

8
00:00:53.150 --> 00:01:01.470
Dirk gulped.

9
00:01:01.471 --> 00:01:07.535
Then he hurried out.

10
00:01:07.536 --> 00:01:10.511
"Uh-oh," thought Tom.

11
00:01:10.512 --> 00:01:15.340
"I think Dirk forgot to hire a new jester."

12
00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:17.380
Dirk came back.

13
00:01:17.381 --> 00:01:21.288
He was dragging a strange boy.

14
00:01:21.289 --> 00:01:24.773
"Here's the new jester!" Dirk said.

15
00:01:24.774 --> 00:01:27.708
The boy looked surprised.

16
00:01:27.709 --> 00:01:31.035
"Make me laugh," said the king.

17
00:01:31.036 --> 00:01:36.428
"Um . . ." The boy looked nervous.

18
00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:39.492
"I can fix things," he said.

19
00:01:39.493 --> 00:01:42.123
"Do you have a hole in your bucket?"

20
00:01:42.124 --> 00:01:47.482
"Ha-ha!" Dirk laughed loudly.

21
00:01:47.483 --> 00:01:55.185
"That's funny!"

22
00:01:55.186 --> 00:01:57.751
But the king frowned.

23
00:01:57.752 --> 00:02:00.713
"Juggle something," the king said.

24
00:02:00.714 --> 00:02:12.717
Dirk got some plates.

25
00:02:12.718 --> 00:02:15.611
The jester threw the plates into the air.

26
00:02:15.612 --> 00:02:17.658
He tried to catch them.

27
00:02:17.659 --> 00:02:22.778
The plates crashed to the floor.

28
00:02:22.779 --> 00:02:27.669
The king and Dirk laughed.

29
00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:30.221
But the queen was angry.

30
00:02:30.222 --> 00:02:34.460
"You broke my best dishes!" she said.

31
00:02:34.461 --> 00:02:38.173
Everybody stopped laughing.

32
00:02:38.174 --> 00:02:42.792
"Tomorrow is the Grand Banquet," the king said.

33
00:02:42.793 --> 00:02:46.962
"Jester, you must make everyone laugh!"

34
00:02:46.963 --> 00:02:51.213
"But no broken dishes!" the queen said.

35
00:02:51.214 --> 00:02:55.793
"I will lock the jester in his room," Dirk said.

36
00:02:55.794 --> 00:02:58.614
"He can practice all night."

37
00:02:58.615 --> 00:03:00.351
The boy spoke.

38
00:03:00.352 --> 00:03:01.800
"But I'm not a—"

39
00:03:01.801 --> 00:03:10.894
"Come with me!" Dirk snapped.
